  4 x DIAGNOSTIC edge reference 2 (line through (0, 60, 40) mm along (1, 0, 0)): spine reversed
  1 x DIAGNOSTIC edge reference 1 (line through (30, 0, 0) mm along (0, 0, 1)): spine forward
  1 x DIAGNOSTIC edge reference 1 (line through (20, 20, 0) mm along (0, 0, 1)): spine forward
